              <string>&lt;b&gt;Sleep stages&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;When both files are exported, the sleep stages selected for the detection are also saved, one file per recording, in a new folder named "slow_wave_sleep_stages" at the cohort report level (recordings with sleep stages only). They are used to compute the slow wave density per division of the night. The tool "Classify Slow Waves" needs the three outputs.</string>
             </property>
