             <widget class="QLabel" name="textEdit">
              <property name="text">
               <string>&lt;b&gt;For each slow wave&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• duration (s): T&lt;br/&gt;• frequency (Hz): 1/T&lt;br/&gt;• peak-to-peak amplitude (µV): H to D&lt;br/&gt;• negative peak amplitude (µV): H&lt;br/&gt;• duration of the negative half-wave (s)&lt;br/&gt;• time from the onset to the negative peak (s)&lt;br/&gt;• duration of the positive half-wave (s)&lt;br/&gt;• time from the onset to the positive peak (s)&lt;br/&gt;• slope to the negative peak (µV/s), from the zero crossing&lt;br/&gt;• slope from the positive peak (µV/s), to the zero crossing&lt;br/&gt;• transition slope (µV/s), from H to D&lt;br/&gt;• transition frequency (Hz): 1/(2τ)</string>
