          <item>
           <widget class="QLabel" name="textEdit_2">
            <property name="text">
             <string>&lt;b&gt;For the cohort&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• slow wave count&lt;br/&gt;• slow wave density (slow waves per minute)&lt;br/&gt;• the average of the characteristics of the slow waves:&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– total (all selected stages), from the sleep onset&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– per sleep stage: only the time spent in each stage&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– per sleep cycle, from the sleep onset&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– per clock hour, from the sleep onset&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– per hour spent in each stage, from the first epoch of each stage</string>
